HivePulse 1.0.2

New in this build:
• The beekeeping year as a picture: switch between List and Overview and drag the year sideways
• Photographs of the work: the plant in flower, a capped queen cell, the mite on a bee
• Do the dates fit where you keep bees? A link under the year opens a short questionnaire
• The bars of the year can now be read out by TalkBack

Please stay in the test and use the app now and then.

